>                      "Original exact-common observations" ///
>                      "Stacked estimation rows") ///
>               fmt(%9.4f %9.4f %12.0fc %12.0fc)) ///
>         label compress nogaps ///
>         addnotes( ///
>             "The sample is the exact realized common-support sample from Step 1.", ///
>             "Exporter-year, importer-year, and directed-pair fixed effects are allowed to differ by mobility measure.", ///
>             "Standard errors are clustered by the original directed pair.", ///
>             "The reported equality p-value tests H0: beta_visitors = beta_tourists." ///
>         )
  5. }
